174 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Wagner IV, Stewart MW, Dorairaj SK (2022) Updates on the diagnosis and management of glaucoma. Mayo Clinic Proceedings: Innovations, Quality & Outcomes 6:618–635. 10.1016/j.mayocpiqo.2022.09.007 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Associated Data This section collects any data citations, data availability statements, or supplementary materials included in this article. Supplementary Materials Supplementary file1 (DOCX 3766 KB) (3.7MB, docx) Data Availability Statement All source data for this work are available upon reasonable request.',3,'2025-10-15 09:50:17','2025-10-15 09:50:17');
